# WIP scratch dirs / files (kept out of git deliberately)
experiments/
eval_virtual_box_ideas.md
overlay-update.zip
# Pre-implementation plans, design sketches, scratch notes — written
# while a feature is in flight, replaced by the design docs under
# docs/design/ when the work lands. Kept out of git so stale planning
# docs don't accumulate next to the canonical design.
docs/plan/

# Claude Code per-user state — `scheduled_tasks.lock`, `settings.local.json`,
# anything else the harness writes locally. Machine-specific, no value to
# other contributors. Equivalent of `.vscode/` for the Claude Code workflow.
.claude/

# Frontend build artefacts (arena/web/ui — Vite + Bun)
arena/web/ui/node_modules/
arena/web/ui/dist/
arena/web/ui/.vite/
arena/web/ui/*.tsbuildinfo

